<title>FRANCE: Rouen Feb 1-12 wheat exports 191,542 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Feb 1-12 wheat exports 191,542 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat exports from Rouen reached</p>
<p>191,542 tonnes between February 1 and February 12, port</p>
<p>officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 484,000 tonnes for the whole of February 1996.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>    West Africa		   22,660</p>
<p>    Egypt			   10,000</p>
<p>    Britain			  7,982</p>
<p>    Greece			  13,350</p>
<p>    Italy			   45,400</p>
<p>    Morocco			 40,050</p>
<p>    Poland			  13,000</p>
<p>    Tunisia			 39,100</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
